# Keep src/server.js out of the Vercel deploy: it calls app.listen(), which makes
# Vercel auto-detect a second "Node server" function (built from src/app.js) that
# crashes with "Invalid export" and breaks the bare / route. The serverless
# entrypoint is api/index.js (which imports src/app.js). server.js is local-dev only.
